            "children": {
              "true0": [
                {
                  "command": "EVENT_IF_FLAGS_COMPARE",
                  "args": {
                    "variable": "96",
                    "flag": 2,
                    "__collapseElse": true
                  },
                  "children": {
                    "true": [
                      {
                        "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                        "args": {
                          "text": [
                            "I don't know what got into him.\nHe just started smashing the\nthing. Had to throw him out. He\nran off, cried he'd \"fix\neverything\".",
                            "I gathered up what I could, still\nhaven't found one of the buttons.\nHalf the record is still lodged\ninside, but the other part's \nmissing.",
                            "Come to think of it, he did run\ntowards Groovy.",
                            "Anyway, maybe go check up on\nhim? See if he's alright. He lives\nover at Saul, by the pharmacy.\nApartment 9."
                          ],
                          "__section": "text",
                          "avatarId": "",
                          "minHeight": 4,
                          "maxHeight": 7,
                          "textX": 1,
                          "textY": 1,
